      "source": "Marshals the object graph with the given root into the provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/transform/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.transform\"><code>Result</code></a>,\nwriting binary data to a <a href=\"MimeContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm.mime\"><code>MimeContainer</code></a>.",
