    {
      "source": "Subinterface of <a href=\"../Marshaller.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm\"><code>Marshaller</code></a> that can use MIME attachments to optimize\nstorage of binary data. Attachments can be added as MTOM, XOP, or SwA.",
